									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2209.msg28589#msg28589">Re: (Rich) White People and Blue Scholars</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #85 on:</b> May 25, 2007, 12:28:38 pm &#187;</div></td>
