									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2209.msg28667#msg28667">Re: (Rich) White People and Blue Scholars</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #86 on:</b> May 26, 2007, 11:27:03 am &#187;</div></td>
