							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Your preaching to the choir Budaho.&nbsp; I agree with everything you said.&nbsp; My issue is that people on here seem to be extremely critical of everything to do with capitalism, but don&#039;t turn that same level of criticism back on Marxist/communist/socialist theory and practice.&nbsp; Red Star just got done defending Mao from any and all criticism even though that criticism is both documentable and illustrated by Flowside&#039;s personal family experience.&nbsp; When Geo says &quot;I&#039;ve experienced the effects of capital first hand&quot; (I may be paraphrasing that) and people cheer, then Flowside basically says &quot;My family&#039;s experienced the effects of Maoism first hand&quot; and the same people become real defensive, it doesn&#039;t add up.&nbsp; If you&#039;re searching for answers and truth, then the critical eye that you aim in one direction should be aimed in all directions equally.</div>
